Comment: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:22.18,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:29.19,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:18.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire to starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow.\NHow are the Guncannon and Guntank?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're still active.\NApproaching entrance to enemy base!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attacking from outside isn't\Ngetting us anywhere...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:34.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let Mr. Kai have all the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I was the first one who landed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I warned you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't attack from all directions\Nwhen I'm this close! Hey, Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you get Lalah involved?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah was never meant to be a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Snap out of it!\NDon't you die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to the mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Gundam pilot..."Amuro", was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.91,0:03:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do I do?\NHow can I beat that Newtype...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. Please tell me.\NWhat should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut down the engines immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut off the engines. Mirai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're touching down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you. Tell all hands\Nto prepare for hand-to-hand combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The controls, they're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch your surroundings!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know where\Nthe enemy will come from!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both the White Base engines are blown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Is everyone okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell Kai and Hayato to cover us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, get a sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Damn Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not over!\NI've only lost the main camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Zeong's been shot down!\NIdentification signal canceled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Red Comet has fallen from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N Field, no response!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S Field, no response! What?! Missiles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send ammo to Block 24 of W Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snakel, Snakel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the Gundam pilot has developed\Nexceptionally because he's a Newtype...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...then perhaps this was inevitable.\NDon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender this base\N15 minutes after my escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to go while Granada and\Nthe homeland have fighting strength left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But escaping at this point would be\Nalmost impossible, ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:17.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as I survive, Zeon is not lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me after we surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back in a prisoner exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get my ship ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right away, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is crawling with the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy ground troops are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, counter with bazookas and rifles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Char must realize the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Zabi family\Nthat needs to be brought down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's he getting in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe I now have the ability\Nto defeat the true enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can sense the Zabi family leader is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may have received\Nthose powers from Lalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one that drew Lalah into the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can't forgive that,\Nyou're misguided, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not for the war, Lalah never\Nwould have awakened as a Newtype.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just an excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's the correct point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come any closer and I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Newtypes like yourself are\Ntoo dangerous right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot!\NYou call that "covering the White Base"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hand-to-hand combat, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's all over the place out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send us a Dom company!\NJust one Zanzibar isn't enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!\NWe have no intention of dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send us escorts, even if they're just Zakus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there a delay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:45.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make them hurry!\NDon't let the other soldiers figure things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The company commander's\Nin trouble in Block 24!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've begun ground combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Up ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because you're the strongest soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't the true enemy the Zabi family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not in my case!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea why I lured you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:21.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you figured that a Newtype\Nhas to use their body like an ordinary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Even a Newtype must\Nbe trained for physical skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's your theory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Amuro! Stop it, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two don't have to fight each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just because there's a war going on\Ndoesn't mean you two have to...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah just told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that Newtypes aren't meant to be\Ntools for destroying each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the battlefield, they're powerful weapons.\NThat's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're a Newtype yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.53,0:11:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop this! Both of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, brother! Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't any reason to hate Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:36.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can't accept him as my enemy,\NI have to get him when I have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought your enemy was the Zabi family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroying that family is no longer\Nmy top priority, Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once Zeon is no more,\Nwe will enter the age of Newtypes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If young Amuro can understand\Nwhat I'm trying to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then become my comrade-in-arms.\NIt would make Lalah happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! How could you even suggest that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Is your forehead wounded...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for this helmet, I'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew Lady Kycilia would be escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had wanted to escort her myself.\NBut unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain, perhaps you could...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect\NHer Excellency on your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rumors of burns on your face\Nwere not true, it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The air here's getting pretty thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out now, Artesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what will you do, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've realized that I can't just\Nlet a Zabi go free, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an adult already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Become a good woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young Amuro is calling for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Lady Kycilia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's about to take off, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:03.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salamis approaching from above!\NWe'll take off at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Down on the floor if you don't have a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,10! 9!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garma, here's a farewell present.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you'll get along with your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:55.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I can't return to the others anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:15:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... if I did... if... I did make it...\NMy brother couldn't have...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this... the end for me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might make it...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the White Base crew?\NAnd Ms. Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I going to join Lalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Newtypes shouldn't be killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:15:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can play with you anytime, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know that it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see them! Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look! You can see things, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Sayla! Stand up!\NGet up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?! Is that you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...But... I don't know where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should go straight ahead...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And after you've gone 500 meters,\Nmake a 90 degree left turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After 500 meters...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seal off hatch 16!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll all die if we don't abandon ship...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seal off the hatch!\NWe don't have any allies left over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have them prepare the launches!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:37.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My dear Fraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:41.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The next time the firing stops,\Nyou can run through safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, it's you. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go to the launches! Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I start running, you run too. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Argh! They're all aiming at the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This ship stands out too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says we should retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation Forces seem to be winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're winning,\Nwe should be okay to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. It looks good. Let's take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base is... going down...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Amuro hadn't called out to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...those flames would have enveloped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Are you telling me\NAmuro isn't on this launch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, he's not. Sayla, you and Mirai\Nwould be able to hear Amuro better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla. You're the daughter of Zeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're closer to a Newtype.\NPlease, search for Amuro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:36.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... But... How do I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no idea...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's the only one missing. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:44.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How can I possibly know that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We heard Amuro's voice just now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could hear him so clearly\Nuntil I got to the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human beings can't\Nchange themselves so conveniently...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! A little to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! Now straight forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! You three...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Yeah! This way! This way! Just do it!\N- This way! It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're almost outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you tell?!\NWh-Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:47.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4! 3! 2! 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:12.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still do have a place to go home to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And nothing could make me happier!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll understand, won't you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:22:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can go to see you anytime, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Universal Century 0080.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.09,0:22:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:56.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...a peace treaty was concluded...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:23:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...between the Earth Federation Government\Nand the Republic of Zeon.
